# Large Language Models

Large Language Models are the foundation of modern Generative AI.

This section explores how LLMs work internally and how they are used to build intelligent applications.

## Topics

- Transformers
- Attention Mechanism
- Tokenization
- Context Windows
- Prompt Engineering
- Sampling
- Temperature
- Function Calling
- Structured Outputs
- Fine-Tuning
- Quantization
- Inference

The goal is to move beyond using LLM APIs and understand the systems behind them.